  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced celery and cook until it starts to soften.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the gochujang and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the fish sauce, sesame oil, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the fermented kimchi and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
